B.amM=new A.ld("Emergency Drugs + Vasoactive Medications tables. For use by qualified clinicians only.",null)
B.amN=new A.ld("Common Poisoning and Antidotes Available card. Mnemonic + clinical notes are research add-ons (Goldfrank's Toxicologic Emergencies, 11th ed.; AAP Committee on Drugs). For use by qualified clinicians only \u2014 verify dose and route against the source guideline before administering.",null)
B.amO=new A.ld("Scorpion Sting staging card. Research add-ons draw on the Bawaskar Pune Protocol (Lancet 2011) and the IAP Standard Treatment Guidelines for Scorpion Envenomation. For use by qualified clinicians only.",null)
